I am still not sure about using Type I or Type III SS in my model (because of biological issues of the design and questions).
However, as you specified at the beginning, this applied when using Type I SS.

I tested you example using Type III SS calculation and, as expected, there are differences. I guess that  it is because the way SS are calculated (maths that I do not fully understand),
