Hi Kieran, sounds an interesting question. Intuition tells me that you may need an average shape to get started. Probably the pupfish data from geomoph would be a better resource with which to code to answer your question.

data(pupfish)
Y.gpa<-gpagen(pupfish$coords, print.progress = FALSE) #GPA-alignment
#landmarks on the body and operculum
land.gps<-rep('a',56); land.gps[39:48]<-'b' # The two modules defined in the user manual

Lv

